&lt;p&gt;What do you think of it? I&amp;rsquo;m looking forward to using this typeface in web/screen work, maybe in display sizes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Does it remind you of some other typeface? At first I ran into this font on the web and thought it was another copy of something else. It turns out to be a standalone typeface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anyway, here&amp;rsquo;s a quick specimen (attached). I like what I&amp;rsquo;m seeing thus far.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Rip-Off ???</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/104694/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 Jul 2013 02:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/104694/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Hi all,&lt;/p&gt;
